     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\" dir=\"rtl\"><i>(עידכונים על המפגש יפורסמו כאן: <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2015/11/168\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2015/11/168&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07ncFlqzBMDyFbjmNO8VPl\">http://r-israel.com/2015/11/168</a> )</i></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">אנחנו שמחים להזמין אתכם לסדנת R בנושא של גרפיקה אינטראקטיבית ב-R בעזרת java script. הסדנה תתאים למשתמשי R צעירים ומנוסים אשר מתעניינים בייצור של גרפים אינטראקטיביים (בתוך עמודי HTML) דרך קוד R.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">הסדנה תתקיים בחסות <a href=\"http://www.statistics.org.il/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.statistics.org.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mfFJv-OglM54W_TT7kspM\">איגוד הסטטיסטיקאים הישראלי</a>, וגם <a href=\"https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0r41dLfe1WhLJyc-MJN51n\">גוגל-קמפוס</a>.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">הסדנה תועבר על ידי אפרת ויל (ראו בהמשך), ומאורגנת על ידי טל גלילי (בתמיכתו המוערכת של ד&quot;ר יונתן רוזנבלט).</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"> _</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">ההשתתפות היא בחינם, אך <strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">דורשת הרשמה מוקדמת</strong> בשני קישורים (סורי על הריבוי, אך אין ברירה):</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">1) עליכם ליצור <a href=\"https://www.campus.co/tel-aviv/en/sign-up\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campus.co/tel-aviv/en/sign-up&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tTf97zuDSYE-pRfu2ASV-\">שם משתמש באתר של גוגל-קמפוס</a> (ההרשמה היא בחינם, ובצד הימני העליון של המסך)</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">2) עליכם להירשם בגוגל-טופס שמופיע ב<a href=\"http://goo.gl/forms/g87AxF1UgV\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/forms/g87AxF1UgV&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nu2MtzrqhfPTEXxrm1agp\">קישור הישיר כאן.</a></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"> _</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">יש הגבלת מקום של 120 איש, אז אנא <a href=\"http://goo.gl/forms/g87AxF1UgV\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/forms/g87AxF1UgV&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nu2MtzrqhfPTEXxrm1agp\">מהרו להירשם.</a> לאחר שירשמו 120 הראשונים, ישלח אליהם מייל שמודיע שהם &quot;בפנים&quot;. לאחר מכן <strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">ההרשמה תישאר פתוחה ל&quot;רשימת המתנה&quot;, </strong>ובשבוע שלפני הסדנא נברר כמה אנשים לא יוכלו להגיע – ונזמין את האנשים מרשימת ההמתנה להגיע. בד&quot;כ כשליש (לפחות) מהאנשים מבטלים ברגע האחרון, אז הרבה מהאנשים של רשימת ההמתנה צפויים לקבל הזמנה להגיע<strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">(אז <a href=\"http://goo.gl/forms/g87AxF1UgV\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/forms/g87AxF1UgV&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nu2MtzrqhfPTEXxrm1agp\">תירשמו <img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/B8cb9azJm4sP1z2k_gv63Nf7Ptan5JWyozteorSEktfQHxmie4fgUY-L3tc0_MtNRFNjeJ1_0PQaUZwlyO0o8KFxGogQQ7xiS-EHbdTK9tIuJPlgRC7grLNCUMegbu8aROs_Cjip-T6f=s0-d-e1-ft#http://i0.wp.com/r-israel.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif?zoom=1.5&amp;w=640\" alt=\":)\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"border:none!important;margin:0px 0.07em!important;padding:0px!important;vertical-align:-0.1em!important;display:inline!important;min-height:1em!important;width:1em!important;background:none!important\"></a> )</strong>.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">כיבוד</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">היות והמפגש בחינם, לא צפוי כיבוד רב (מעבר לתה וקפה שמציאים גוגל קמפוס). אי לכך רצוי שתביאו ארוחת ערב / תאכלו מראש.</p><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">היכן?<br></strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">בגוגל קמפוס:</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">ELECTRA TOWER<br>98 YIGAL ALON ST.<br>TEL AVIV<br>34TH FLOOR</p><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">מתי?</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">הסדנה תתקיים ביום ראשון, ה-03/01/2016 בין השעות 18:30-21:30</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">לו&quot;ז (טנטטיבי):</p><ul style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 1.5em 24px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square;background:transparent\"><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">18:30-19:00 התכנסות</li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">19:00-20:00 – אפרת</li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">20:30 – 20:00 הפסקה</li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">21:30 – 20:30- אפרת (המשך)</li></ul><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">קהל היעד?</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">משתמשי R.</p><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">נושאי הסדנא</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:underline;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">להלן נושא ההרצאה (ההרצאות יועברו בעברית):</strong></span></p></div><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;direction:ltr;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:large;background:transparent\">Interactive Charts with HTMLWidgets &amp; JavaScript</span></b></p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;direction:ltr;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Join a journey to explore interactive chart possibilities in R using Htmlwidgets, which created a bridge between R and innovative visualization libraries powered by JavaScript.  Learn how to produce interactive web visualizations with R console, &#39;R Markdown&#39; documents, and &#39;Shiny&#39; web applications. Get a glimpse into the world of web development and get familiar with new possibilities for dynamic data exploration using popular JavaScript libraries.</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;direction:ltr;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Examples:</strong></p><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;direction:ltr;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><ul style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 1.5em 24px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square;background:transparent\"><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><a href=\"http://www.htmlwidgets.org/index.html\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.htmlwidgets.org/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497108950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2gzrTJ2Jt_JuIsj806kQ-w\">http://www.htmlwidgets.org/index.html</a> – the libraries in the show case</strong></li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\"><a href=\"http://hrbrmstr.github.io/streamgraph/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:tra